From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vincenzopio <43883474+vincenzopio@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 02:06:58 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] licensing: get the key of a package's content, without
 panicking.

content_key gets the key that decrypts a package's content. The licensing service gives the
content's license for the signed-in user, with the same MSA tokens as a game license, and the
license holds the key wrapped with the device's key. A user who does not own the content gets
NotEntitled. get_license_content no longer panics on an answer without a readable license.

Original work for macrock (GPL-3.0-only, as Xodus).

Topic: install
